The international network of dry cleaners Clean Control presents the first automatic order pick-up and drop-off service point in the Baltic States! Just register in the mobile application, receive the bag, pack the orders and place in the automatic service point! We will take care of your orders further. Simple, convenient, fast!

The mobile application of the international network of dry cleaners Clean Control enables its customers to:
• Always have an up-to-date price list for dry cleaning services at hand;
• Find out the addresses of automatic service points;
• Through Personal account sign up, the client can:
o hand over orders to an automatic service point;
o view the orders, their status and history;
o confirm orders for sending to work;
o pay for orders using a bank card;
o receive notifications about the status of orders;
o view information about available discount;
o contact the dry cleaners via live chat, phone call or email.

